About WPP Media

WPP is the creative transformation company. We use the power of creativity to build better futures for our people, planet, clients and communities. For more information, visit wpp.com.

WPP Media is WPP’s global media collective. In a world where media is everywhere and in everything, we bring the best platform, people, and partners together to create limitless opportunities for growth. For more information, visit wppmedia.com

At WPP Media, we believe in the power of our culture and our people. It’s what elevates us to deliver exceptional experiences for both our clients and each other. In this role it will be critical to embrace WPP &amp; WPP Media’s shared core values:

• Be&nbsp; Extraordinary by Leading Collectively to Inspire transformational Creativity.

• Create an&nbsp; Open environment by Balancing People and Client Experiences by Cultivating Trust.

• Lead&nbsp; Optimistically by Championing Growth and Development to Mobilize the Enterprise.

Reporting of the role &nbsp;

This role reports to  Biddable Social Manager &nbsp;

3 best things about the job: &nbsp;

• Get to work in a truly integrated team handling 360 aspects for a brand &nbsp;

•  Will work closely with the leading publishers such as Facebook, TikTok &amp; Line &nbsp;

• Gain hands-on experience and become a specialist in social media advertising across multiple platforms. &nbsp;

Measures of success&nbsp;

In three months: &nbsp;

• Understood the complete biddable media scenario on client’s business across social platforms (including but not limited to Facebook, TikTok, LINE, X, and LinkedIn.)

• Handled day to day tasks / requirement effectively &nbsp;

In six months: &nbsp;

• Optimized implementation in all biddable media platforms

• Recommended and implemented best practice

•  Explored and executed an innovation in one of the biddable media platforms &nbsp;

In 12 months: &nbsp;

• Exceed client expectations in terms of biddable media implementation

• Create a road-map for the next year. &nbsp;

Role Summary and Impact &nbsp;

• Manage&nbsp;real time&nbsp;bidding campaigns on multiple platforms for clients. &nbsp;

• Setup, monitor, report and analyze&nbsp;advertising campaigns to deliver on client KPIs

• Stay updated with platform changes and new features through regular training, active research, attending webinars, and completing key certifications such as Meta Blueprint and other relevant online courses.

• To be the custodian of your client's advertising presence on social platforms &amp; the go-to-person on matters social.

• You will become an advocate of your wider team's work and a trusted client partner by attend briefings and strategy sessions, building social ads designed to deliver business value and client KPIs.

• You'll become a trusted client partner with your inherent knowledge of their business and how social can elevate brand and direct response messaging/outcomes based on their needs.

• Keep your client leads up to date on social best practices - content, platforms, and tools within the paid social ecosystem.

• Participate in workshops, training sessions and team building events. &nbsp;

Skills and Experience &nbsp;

• 0-3 years of experience in digital advertising (experience in a biddable role is a plus). Fresh graduates are also welcome.

